---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
---
<Layout>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="nav wrap"><a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Safwan Ahmed home">sa<span>.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#education">Education</a><a href="#research">Research</a><a href="#contact">Contact <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav></header>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> SAFWAN AHMED / DEVELOPER</div>
      <h1>Curiosity into code.<br/>Ideas into <em>reality.</em></h1>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><p>I build across AI, software, and systems.<br/>Always exploring how things work—and how<br class="desktop"/> to make them work better.</p><a class="button" href="#work">Explore my work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div>
      <div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit-ring r1"></div><div class="orbit-ring r2"></div><div class="orbit-ring r3"></div><div class="orbit-core">&lt;/&gt;</div><span class="orbit-label l1">BUILD</span><span class="orbit-label l2">EXPLORE</span><span class="orbit-label l3">ITERATE</span></div>
      <div class="hero-foot"><span>INDEPENDENT PROJECTS. CONTINUOUS LEARNING.</span><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div>
    </section>
    <section id="work" class="work wrap">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WORK</div><h2>A few things<br/>I’ve been building<span>.</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/SafwanAhmed08" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">All repositories ↗</a></div>
      <div class="projects-grid">{projects.map((project) => <article class="project"><div class="project-info"><div class="project-kicker"><span>{project.number}</span>{project.type}</div><h3>{project.title}</h3><p>{project.description}</p><ul class="tags">{project.tags.map(tag=><li>{tag}</li>)}</ul><a class="text-link" href={`/projects/${project.slug}/`}>Read project breakdown <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>)}</div>
    </section>
    <section id="about" class="about"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">02 / A LITTLE ABOUT ME</div><h2>Built on curiosity.<br/>Improved by doing<span>.</span></h2></div><div class="about-copy"><p>I’m Safwan, an MSc Artificial Intelligence student at the University of Edinburgh, building at the intersection of AI, software, and systems.</p><p>My experience spans conversational AI, computer vision, retrieval-grounded applications, and network security. I enjoy taking ideas from an initial experiment to a practical application.</p><div class="learning"><span class="dot"></span><div><small>CURRENTLY BUILDING & LEARNING</small><p>Currently building an Agentic job finder. Alongside it, I’m exploring probabilistic modelling, inference, and decision-making under uncertainty; language modelling, Transformers, and the training of large language models; and the systems behind scalable data retrieval, GPU computing, model training, and deployment. I’m developing these foundations through my MSc coursework at the University of Edinburgh, while learning CI/CD through hands-on projects.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="wrap toolkit"><span class="eyebrow">TOOLS I WORK WITH</span><div><span>Python</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>PyTorch</span><span>FastAPI</span><span>Next.js</span><span>Docker</span></div></div></section>
    <section id="background" class="background wrap">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">03 / EXPERIENCE & EDUCATION</div><h2>The experience<br/>behind the work<span>.</span></h2></div></div>
      <div id="experience" class="background-section"><h3>Experience</h3><div>
        <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-meta">JAN — MAY 2026</div><h4>Machine Learning Intern</h4><div class="resume-place">PESU Venture Labs</div><p>Built a prototype conversational customization engine that translates natural-language requirements into validated, persistent tenant manifests.</p><ul><li>Designed a LangGraph pipeline to inspect a Next.js repository, plan changes, and apply branding, themes, copy, and assets across the frontend and admin portal.</li><li>Implemented tenant state management, repository indexing, confirmation workflows, validation, and customization reporting through REST APIs.</li></ul><div class="resume-tools">LangGraph · Next.js · LLM integration · REST APIs</div></article>
        <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-meta">JUN — JUL 2025</div><h4>Computer Vision Intern</h4><div class="resume-place">Cyphertek Solutions Pvt Limited</div><p>Developed a YOLOv3 pipeline for detecting defects in LCD displays, supported by automated image preparation and model tuning.</p><ul><li>Created OpenCV preprocessing and augmentation scripts to generate training datasets.</li><li>Applied hyperparameter tuning, custom anchor generation, profiling, and performance benchmarking to improve detection performance.</li></ul><div class="resume-tools">YOLOv3 · OpenCV · Computer vision · Model evaluation</div></article>
      </div></div>
      <div id="education" class="background-section"><h3>Education</h3><div>
        <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-meta">EXPECTED 2027</div><h4>MSc in Artificial Intelligence</h4><div class="resume-place">University of Edinburgh</div><p>Edinburgh, United Kingdom</p></article>
        <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-meta">JUL 2026</div><h4>B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering</h4><div class="resume-place">PES University</div><p>Bangalore, India · First class with distinction</p></article>
      </div></div>
      <div id="research" class="background-section"><h3>Research & capstone</h3><div>
        <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-meta">SEP 2024 — DEC 2025 / CAPSTONE</div><h4>Ensemble Intrusion Detection with Conversational AI</h4><p>Developed a two-stage intrusion detection system: binary traffic classification followed by an ensemble of experts for DDoS HTTP, DDoS TCP, DDoS ICMP, and port-scanning detection.</p><ul><li>Used confidence-based voting, the EdgeIoT dataset, and NS3 simulations, with detection over five-second packet windows.</li><li>Integrated RASA for conversational threat analysis and mitigation guidance, with Gemini as a fallback.</li></ul><div class="resume-place">Presented at the 15th Computer Science On-line Conference, 2026</div><a class="text-link paper-link" href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-032-38800-1_20" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read paper on Springer ↗</a></article>
        <article class="resume-entry"><div class="resume-meta">JUN — DEC 2024 / RESEARCH</div><h4>Conversational AI for Industrial IoT Threat Detection</h4><p>Built a four-layer TensorFlow DNN for classifying 14+ cyber threats, including DDoS, SQL injection, and man-in-the-middle attacks. Combined threat classification with Gemini-powered analysis and a React and Flask interface.</p><div class="resume-place">Presented at the 9th edition of SmartCom</div><a class="text-link paper-link" href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-981-96-7517-3_34" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read paper on Springer ↗</a></article>
      </div></div>
    </section>
    <section id="contact" class="contact wrap"><div class="eyebrow">04 / WHAT’S NEXT?</div><h2>Good things start<br/>with a <em>conversation.</em></h2><div class="contact-bottom"><p>Interested in AI, software, or a collaboration?<br/>Let’s get in touch.</p><div class="contact-links"><a class="button" href="mailto:safwanahmed2004@gmail.com">Send me an email <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/safwan-ahmed-881a77287/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/SafwanAhmed08" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://orcid.org/0009-0003-4805-9810" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Safwan Ahmed on ORCID">ORCID ↗</a></div></div></div></section>
  </main>
  <footer class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="#">sa<span>.</span></a><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Safwan Ahmed</span><a href="#">Back to top ↑</a></footer>
</Layout>
